<title>USA: Fresh Del Monte FY 96 oper income increases.</title>
<headline>Fresh Del Monte FY 96 oper income increases.</headline>
<dateline>CORAL GABLES, Fla. 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper	profit	45,700   profit	 6,700</p>
<p> Net	   loss     133,700     loss	72,300</p>
<p> Revs			 1,189		    1,068</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>    NOTE:   Fresh Del Monte Produce N.V. said its net income</p>
<p>for fiscal year 1996 included acquisition related expenses of $3.2 million, a special goodwill charge of $138.7 million and a special charge of $141.9 million.</p>
<p>Net income for the fiscal year 1995 included special goodwill charges of $44.9 million and special charges of $44.9 million.</p>
</text>
